+- Max Threads per SM: {{ gpu_specs.max_threads_per_sm | default("unknown") }}
+- L1 Cache per SM: {{ gpu_specs.l1_cache_kb | default("unknown") }} KB
+- L2 Cache: {{ gpu_specs.l2_cache_mb | default("unknown") }} MB
